<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ko"><head><title>[TabControl] 초기 탭 선택하기</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/book.css" type="text/css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="application/xhtml+xml; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="EPB-UUID" content="f1fbcef72ff0a2ec" /></head><body><div class="chapter_content"><h1 id="r_c28ea77785959f84" class="chapter_title">[TabControl] 초기 탭 선택하기</h1><h1 id="r_5f97b05b6e96a82b" class="element heading1" data-element-id="5f97b05b6e96a82b"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">1</span><span>개요</span></div></h1><pre id="r_4fdefbea32119c04" class="element pre" data-element-id="4fdefbea32119c04">TabControl의 'selectedTabIndex' 속성을 사용하여 컴포넌트가 로드될 때 선택될 탭을 설정한 예제입니다.</pre><p id="r_ff9fc6ceaafdd548" class="element r_example_link_p" data-element-id="ff9fc6ceaafdd548"><a class="link" href="http://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00334">P00334</a></p><h1 id="r_ca9f6c8034fdb818" class="element heading1" data-element-id="ca9f6c8034fdb818"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">2</span><span>구현된 기능</span></div></h1><ul id="r_938558b62452fe14" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="938558b62452fe14"><li><p>'selectedTabIndex' 속성을 사용하여 탭 선택하기</p></li></ul><h1 id="r_a73b8c06f24ea3af" class="element heading1" data-element-id="a73b8c06f24ea3af"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">3</span><span>예제 테스트 방법</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_c8db85643bce0e14" class="element heading2" data-element-id="c8db85643bce0e14"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.1</span><span>'selectedTabIndex' 속성을 '1'로 설정한 경우</span></div></h2><pre id="r_4107e92d1cf7a27f" class="element pre" data-element-id="4107e92d1cf7a27f">예제 영역 '<span class="r_th_title_1_span">selectedIndex : 1</span>'에서 테스트합니다.</pre><div id="r_9bc7c1cfa03d649c" class="element step1" data-element-id="9bc7c1cfa03d649c"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>실행된 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><pre id="r_368b393778270d43" class="element pre step1_indent" data-element-id="368b393778270d43">TabControl에 'TAB1', 'TAB2' 탭이 구성되어 있고, 'TAB2' 탭이 선택된 상태입니다.</pre><div id="r_6e2a7707f9774c39" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="6e2a7707f9774c39"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 1.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1478.png" width="324" height="105" /></p></div><h2 id="r_8cb9926123f6b308" class="element heading2" data-element-id="8cb9926123f6b308"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.2</span><span>'selectedTabIndex' 속성을 '0'으로 설정한 경우</span></div></h2><pre id="r_61f13ba5a9b532c0" class="element pre" data-element-id="61f13ba5a9b532c0">예제 영역 '<span class="r_th_title_1_span">selectedIndex : 0</span>'에서 테스트합니다.</pre><div id="r_6cd0b8c74bb7546a" class="element step1" data-element-id="6cd0b8c74bb7546a"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>실행된 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><pre id="r_0a56e118d079b5d4" class="element pre step1_indent" data-element-id="0a56e118d079b5d4">TabControl에 'TAB1', 'TAB2' 탭이 구성되어 있고, 'TAB1' 탭이 선택된 상태입니다.</pre><div id="r_7d33b65b68f04d19" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="7d33b65b68f04d19"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 2.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1479.png" width="325" height="106" /></p></div><h1 id="r_869a7941d0efebb2" class="element heading1" data-element-id="869a7941d0efebb2"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">4</span><span>구현 예시</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_0b692918942e3ba6" class="element heading2" data-element-id="0b692918942e3ba6"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.1</span><span>속성을 사용해서 화면 로딩 시 선택된 탭 설정하기</span></div></h2><pre id="r_485eeb7879cde19f" class="element pre" data-element-id="485eeb7879cde19f">TabControl의 속성을 설정합니다.</pre><ul id="r_c105d79b5eae689a" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="c105d79b5eae689a"><li><p><span class="r_blue001_span">[필수] selectedIndex="탭의 인덱스"</span></p><p>설정 예시) 첫 번째 탭을 선택하는 경우</p><p>selectedIndex="0"</p></li></ul><div id="r_02b8cacce182bce5" class="element image" data-element-id="02b8cacce182bce5"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 3.</span>웹스퀘어 스튜디오의 Component View - 속성 설정 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1480.png" width="315" height="138" /></p></div><div id="r_f2fe487e12224b22" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="f2fe487e12224b22"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 1.</span>Source</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- selectedIndex를 1로 설정해 두 번째 탭으로 시작하도록 설정 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&lt;w2:tabControl <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">selectedIndex</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"1"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>    <span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- 중략 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&lt;/w2:tabControl&gt;</pre></div><h1 id="r_fc3be207661e9078" class="element heading1" data-element-id="fc3be207661e9078"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">5</span><span>주요 API</span></div></h1><ul id="r_eb2aae3621b0e6b3" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="eb2aae3621b0e6b3"><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_property_span">selectedIndex</span></p></li></ul></div></body></html>